---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactBlock from '../components/ContactBlock.astro';

// The company: what the name means, why it exists, the scales it works at, who does the work.
// This page sells nothing. What can be asked for is on the home page.
---

<BaseLayout title="Practice" description="Statecraft is the craft of good rule. What the name means, the three scales the practice works at, the thinking behind it, and who does the work." tone="field">
  <section class="hero field">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1 aria-label="The craft of good rule.">
        <span class="rise" style="--i:0" aria-hidden="true"><span>The craft</span></span>
        <span class="rise" style="--i:1" aria-hidden="true"><span>of good rule<span class="stop">.</span></span></span>
      </h1>
      <div class="hero-foot">
        <p class="lede">That is what statecraft means. The practice exists because good rule is scarce and does not maintain itself: what is not built into a structure leaves with the person who carried it.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="link-rule" href="/thesis">The thesis</a>
          <a class="link-rule" href="/disciplines">The disciplines</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section" aria-label="The name">
    <ul class="defs">
      <li class="reveal">
        <h2 class="w">State</h2>
        <p>The unit that must be governed. The condition a system is in. The state of affairs, which has to be seen clearly before any work begins.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <h2 class="w">Craft</h2>
        <p>Direct contact with the material. Honest assessment, skilled making, the hand on the work.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <h2 class="w">Systems</h2>
        <p>What remains after individuals leave. What compounds. What holds an obligation in place when nobody is watching.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section" aria-labelledby="scales-h">
    <h2 class="statement reveal" id="scales-h">One craft, three scales.</h2>
    <ul class="scales">
      <li class="reveal"><div class="card">
        <span class="glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="b" cx="50" cy="50" r="50" /></svg></span>
        <h3>Person</h3>
        <p>A founder, an executive, a team. Rule begins with one person who sees clearly and can act on what they see. The work here is capability that stays with them.</p>
      </div></li>
      <li class="reveal"><div class="card">
        <span class="glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><rect class="b" width="100" height="100" /></svg></span>
        <h3>Institution</h3>
        <p>A clinic, a house, a supplier, a cause. What one person carried is built into parts that run without them: how a request arrives, how a date is held, who hears about it and when.</p>
      </div></li>
      <li class="reveal"><div class="card">
        <span class="glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path class="b" d="M50 0 L100 100 H0 Z" /></svg></span>
        <h3>Network</h3>
        <p>Several parties bound to one another: partners, an alliance, a community. The working parts are the terms between them: what each owes, what each can see, how a decision is reached and kept.</p>
      </div></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="after"><a class="btn ghost" href="/">What you can ask for</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section" aria-labelledby="why-h">
    <h2 class="statement reveal" id="why-h">The thinking.</h2>
    <ul class="index">
      <li><a href="/thesis">
        <span class="title">Thesis</span>
        <span class="who wide">Ten propositions on good rule.</span>
      </a></li>
      <li><a href="/disciplines">
        <span class="title">Disciplines</span>
        <span class="who wide">Structural dynamics, natural law, currency design, operative traditions.</span>
      </a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap split" aria-labelledby="who-h">
    <div class="left">
      <h2 id="who-h">One person, who also does the work.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="right ledger">
      <div><span class="name">Moritz Bierling</span><span class="meta">Principal</span><span class="desc"><a href="https://moritzbierling.com" rel="noopener" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);">moritzbierling.com</a></span></div>
      <div><span class="name muted">Entity</span><span class="meta"></span><span class="desc">Statecraft Systems LLC · A US company.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ContactBlock />
</BaseLayout>
